# meadow saffron
# a bulb
# left by the builder of bulb, 30 September 2026
# Plant it soon: it keeps an appointment. It flowers bare, like a crocus in
# the grass, and its leaves are a long time coming.
kind: bulb
wakes: when the days shrink past 11.3 hours
stands: 75
leaves: 4 broad 24 cm, in spring after the flowers
stem: 12
flower: 6 #c58fc4
scent: none
multiplies: offsets and seed
leaf: plain
coat: papery
hardy: -16
